# Tata Group – Data Visualization Project

## Project Overview

This project was completed as part of the **Tata Group Data Visualization Virtual Experience Program**. The project focuses on analyzing an Online Retail dataset and creating interactive dashboards using Microsoft Power BI to answer business-related questions.

The main objective was to transform raw business data into meaningful visual insights that can help in understanding business performance and supporting data-driven decision-making.

## Objectives

- Analyze the provided Online Retail dataset.
- Understand and interpret business-related questions.
- Identify important trends and patterns in the data.
- Create interactive dashboards using Power BI.
- Present insights through appropriate charts and visualizations.

## Tools & Technologies Used

- **Microsoft Power BI** – Dashboard creation and data visualization.
- **Data Analysis** – Analyzing business data and identifying trends.
- **Data Visualization** – Presenting insights through charts and graphs.

## Project Files

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `online_retail(1).pbix` | Power BI dashboard file |
| `questions.txt` | Business questions provided for the project |
| `Visuals Hints.pdf` | Visualization guidelines and hints |

## Key Learning Outcomes

- Gained practical experience in Power BI.
- Learned to analyze real-world business datasets.
- Developed interactive dashboards.
- Improved data interpretation and visualization skills.
- Understood how data can support business decision-making.

## Certificate

Successfully completed the project and received a certificate of completion.

## Conclusion

This project provided hands-on experience in data analytics and business intelligence. It helped me understand how raw data can be transformed into meaningful visualizations and actionable business insights using Microsoft Power BI.

